  "name": "Expense Summarization Assistant",
  "description": "This agent aggregates expense validation results, prediction outcomes, and policy actions, classifies them into open issues, acknowledgements, failures, defaults, and recommendations, merges overlapping user actions, determines whether user input is required, and generates a structured summary and call-to-action for downstream notification and response handling.",
